1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,670
Nobody tells you ChatGPT can invent a source.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,120
Studies, quotes, links. All very confident.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,320
But it gave me a link!

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,770
Click it. Sometimes it goes nowhere.

5
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:10,970
So it's lying?

6
00:00:11,170 --> 00:00:14,540
No. It predicts what a source should look like.

7
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:16,740
That's literally lying with extra steps.

8
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:20,690
Fair. Fix: turn on web search, then click every link.

9
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:24,070
If you can't open it, you can't quote it.

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:27,270
So the source doesn't exist until I click it.

11
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,840
Comment SOURCES for my 3-step check. Click every source.

